cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MuchXs in published work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "MuchXs: charge-transfer multiplet theory for X-ray spectroscopy"
abstract: >-
  Platform for simulating and fitting XAS, XRS, PES, XES, RPES and RIXS of
  3d, 4d and rare-earth ions with charge-transfer multiplet theory, using one
  Hamiltonian and parameter set for all spectroscopies.
authors:
